# The program of protocols/iteration-over-maps-and-sets.ir with a budget of one logged edge: flow stops, and the build goes on without its results.
# The build says so once, and the program that comes out of the pass that applies results is valid
# OPTIONS: limit=MaxValueFlowEdgesLogged:1
# LOSS: MaxValueFlowEdgesLogged
# DIAGNOSTIC: ProgramTooLargeToAnalyze
# RUN: valueflow-apply
# CHECK: function f0
# PROGRAM-OF: ../protocols/iteration-over-maps-and-sets.ir
